  "id": "knowledge-of-results",
  "term": "knowledge of results",
  "definition": "Knowledge of results is feedback that tells a learner what outcome they actually achieved, such as showing whether their performance matched the intended result. In this context, it gives an objective basis for noticing errors and successes, which can support self-correction and build confidence through repeated mastery experiences.",
